@startuml authorization-eidas-sequence
skinparam svgDimensionStyle false

participant App
participant "FHIR Server\n(EU Resource Server)" as FHIR
participant "EU Authorization Server" as AS
participant "eIDAS / EUDI Wallet" as eIDAS

== Get Access Token ==

alt Pre-authorized Backend Service
    App -> AS++: Token request
    App <-- AS--: Access token
else Interactive user or patient launch
    App -> AS++: Authorization request
    AS -> eIDAS++: Authenticate user when required\nby the environment
    AS <-- eIDAS--: Authentication result / presentation
    note right of AS
        Validate result
        Establish user session
        Apply authorization policy
    end note
    App <-- AS--: Redirect with authorization code
    App -> AS++: Token request\n(code)
    App <-- AS--: Access token and applicable launch context
end

== Access Content ==

App -> FHIR++: Protected resource request (access token)
App <-- FHIR--: Authorized response

@enduml